 if white:extra+=f" Exploratory whitened-distance augmentation yielded {pct(metric(white,'pair_aef')['macro_risk'])}%/{pct(metric(white,'pair_tessera')['macro_risk'])}% mismatch versus {pct(metric(white,'hydro_pair')['macro_risk'])}%/{pct(metric(white,'hydro_decoder')['macro_risk'])}% for its physical comparators. This is a within-learner comparison."
